{"t":"IEX","n":"IDEX Corporation","nKo":"아이덱스","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":227.92,"chg":8.28,"chgPct":0.0377,"prev":219.64,"dayH":229.16,"dayL":224.25,"w52H":243.8,"w52L":168.92,"vol":1046276,"avgVol":572540,"mcap":16741361664,"pe":31.66,"fpe":23.18,"eps":7.2,"feps":9.83,"pb":4.18,"div":2.92,"divY":0.0128,"beta":0.95,"short":2396503,"shortPct":0.0373,"shortRatio":3.11,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Industrials","sKo":"산업재","i":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","iKo":"특수산업기계","city":"Northbrook","emp":8700,"web":"https://www.idexcorp.com","sum":"IDEX Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, provides applied solutions in the United States, North America, Europe, Asia, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Health & Science Technologies (HST), Fluid & Metering Technologies (FMT) and Fire & Safety/Diversified Products (FSDP). The HST segment designs, produces, and distributes a range of precision fluidics, positive displacement pumps, powder and liquid processing technologies, drying systems, micro-precision components, pneumatic components and sealing solutions, high performance molded and extruded sealing components, and custom mechanical and shaft seals. This segment also offers engineered hygienic mixers and valves, biocompatible medical devices and implantable products, air compressors and blowers, optical ","sumKo":"IDEX Corporation은 자회사와 함께 미국, 북미, 유럽, 아시아 및 국제적으로 응용 솔루션을 제공합니다. HST(보건 및 과학 기술), FMT(유체 및 계측 기술), FSDP(화재 및 안전/다양한 제품)의 세 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. HST 부문은 다양한 정밀 유체공학, 용적형 펌프, 분말 및 액체 처리 기술, 건조 시스템, 초정밀 부품, 공압 부품 및 씰링 솔루션, 고성능 성형 및 압출 씰링 부품, 맞춤형 기계 및 샤프트 씰을 설계, 생산 및 유통합니다. 이 부문은 또한 엔지니어링된 위생 믹서 및 밸브, 생체 적합성 의료 기기 및 이식형 제품, 공기 압축기 및 송풍기, 광학 장치를 제공합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":3181900000,"ni":586900000},{"y":2023,"rev":3273900000,"ni":596100000},{"y":2024,"rev":3268800000,"ni":505000000},{"y":2025,"rev":3457500000,"ni":483200000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":899100000,"ni":128300000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":886900000,